        "faq2": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What kind of fragrance is best for a child?",
            "answer": "A light, alcohol-free mist or oil is best. Children suit soft, low-intensity scents rather than strong sprays, so look for gentle formulas and apply only a small amount. Each product page lists its ingredients so you can check suitability."
